  "_comment": [
    "A real GET /api/v2/error-tracking/issues/{id}?include=samples&filter[samples.biases]=git_metadata",
    "response, captured 2026-11-08 and sanitised: the identity in error_message, the host, the AWS",
    "account tags and the image digests are replaced or dropped, and event is trimmed to the fields a",
    "mapper reads. Structure and field names are untouched.",
    "",
    "This is the no-Source-Code-Integration case, which is what the API returns today: error_stack is",
    "an empty object and there are no git_commit_sha or git_repository_url fields at all. The whole",
    "code section of a report is therefore unpopulatable, and SourceURL returns the empty string.",
    "Keep a second fixture for the SCI case when a service has it enabled.",
    "",
    "Note error.stack is absent and only error.handling_stack is present: dd-trace-go moved the",
    "handling stack to its own field in v2.7.0, and this service runs v2.8.1. The handling stack is",
    "where the error was recorded, not where it was thrown, so its top frames are tracer internals."
  ],
